{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-06-09 10:00:00', 'title': 'PFIZER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF REVIRAL', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF REVIRAL, A PRIVATELY HELD, CLINICAL-STAGE BIOPHARMACEUTICAL COMPANY FOCUSED ON DISCOVERING, DEVELOPING, AND COMMERCIALIZING NOVEL ANTIVIRAL THERAPEUTICS THAT TARGET RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (RSV). REVIRAL BRINGS TO PFIZER A PORTFOLIO OF PROMISING THERAPEUTIC CANDIDATES, INCLUDING SISUNATOVIR, AN ORALLY ADMINISTERED INHIBITOR DESIGNED TO BLOCK FUSION OF THE RSV VIRUS TO THE HOST'}